$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: A typical procedure for the Heck reaction of
iodobenzene with n-butyl acrylate: To the above catalyst solution (0.01
mmol of Pd) were added iodobenzene (1.0 mmol), n-butyl acrylate (1.4
mmol), and KOAc (1.4 mmol). After vigorous stirring of the reaction
mixture at 100 °C, the yields of products were determined by GC using an
internal standard method. yield (99%)
