$DATUM N-tert-Butyl-4-[(E)-1-(tert-butylcarbamoyl)buta-1’,3’-dien-2’-yl]-4-phenylpiperidine-4’-
carboxamide (entry 7). Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos
(9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1-[1’-(tert-butoxycarbonyl)-4-phenylpiperidin-4-yl]vinyl diphenyl
phosphate (321.3 mg, 0.60 mmol), N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40
mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol)
dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at
100°C. The crude product was purified by flash chromatography on silica
gel using CH2Cl2:ethyl acetate (95:5) as eluent. This afforded 153.3 mg
of the title compound (93 % yield) as a white amorphous solid. 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CD3CN-C6D6 (1:1)) δ (ppm) 7.49 (m, 4H), 7.38 (m, 1H), 6.98 (d,
1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 6.49 bs, 1H, NH, 6.32 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 5.72 (s,
1H), 5.38 (s, 1H), 3.66 (m, 2H), 3.48 (m, 2H), 2.16 (m, 2H), 1.65 (s,
9H), 1.51 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN-C6D6) δ (ppm) 165.6, 155.8,
150.8, 146.0, 139.9, 129.8, 128.1, 127.7, 126.4, 115.0, 80.0, 51.9, 46.2,
42.0, 35.5, 29.4, 29.1. HRMS C25H36N2O3 [M+Na+]: 435.2624 found:
435.2642.
