$DATUM Henderson, Jaclyn L.; Edwards, Andrew S.; Greaney, Michael F.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2006), 128(23), 7426-7427

