$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-5,5-dimethyl-4-methylenehex-2-enamide (2) (entry 7).
Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
3,3-dimethyl but-1-en-2-yl diphenylphosphate (199.4 mg, 0.60 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a 1:1 DMFDioxane mixture (3
mL) were reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude product was purified by
flash chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2 as eluent. This afforded
76 mg of the title compound (91% yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400
MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 7.20 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 6.41 (bs, 1H, NH), 6.20
(d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 5.23 (s, 1H), 5.02 (s, 1H), 1.36 (s, 9H), 1.24 (s,
9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) 165.8, 155.6, 139.8, 125.4, 111.1, 51.6,
35.9, 29.6, 29.0. HRMS C13H23NO [M+Na+]: 232.1677 found: 232.1675.
