$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (1-Formyl-4-methoxy-6,7-dihydro-5aH-dibenzofuran-9a-yl)-acetonitrile 102
To a 25mL of flask was added nitrile 101 (350mg, 1.0mmol), Pd(OAc)2
(34mg, 0.15mmol), Ag2CO3 (827mg, 3.0mmol) and dppp (62mg, 0.15mmol). The
flask was evacuated and filled with argon (3x). Degassed toluene (10mL)
was added and the resulting suspension was heated at 107°C for 24h.
Direct flash chromatography (20-30% ethyl acetate in petroleum ether)
gave the product as a colorless liquid (246mg, 91%). colorless liquid IR
(film) 2932, 2841, 2252, 1683, 1609, 1574, 1508, 1437, 1286, 1235, 1203,
1172, 1118, 1079, 1046, 915, 765, 730 cm-1. 1H NMR (500MHz, CDCl3) δ
9.80, (s, 1H), 7.39 (d, J=8.0Hz, 1H), 6.95 (d, J=8.5Hz, 1H), 6.02-5.94
(m, 2H), 4.99 (t, J=3.0Hz, 1H), 3.98 (s, 3H), 3.47 (d, J=17Hz, 1H), 3.14
(d, J=17Hz, 1H), 2.40-2.30 (m, 1H), 2.30-2.20 (m, 1H), 2.10-1.90 (m, 2H).
13C NMR (125MHz, CDCl3) δ 191.56, 150.22, 148.79, 131.93, 130.52, 130.40,
126.40, 125.89, 117.38, 110.91, 86.21, 56.15, 48.09, 25.98, 23.39, 18.76.
HRMS: Calcd for C16H15NO3(M+): 269.1052; Found: 269.1054. [α]D= -199.0
(c=1.25, CH2Cl2).
